| forced 100/full | speed 100 + duplex full (14:03:58-14:04:00) | notconnect then connected trunk full 100 (1.2 s) while the 4050 was still auto (4050 read a-half a-100: parallel detection) | after `speed 100` + `duplex full` on the 4050 (14:04:5x): connected 10 full 100 (1.2 s) | both ends (u0c, u1c) |
| forced 10/full | speed 10 (duplex full kept, 14:0x) | notconnect trunk full 10 until the 4050 matched, then connected trunk full 10 (u1d) | after `speed 10` on the 4050: connected 10 full 10 (1.2 s, u0d) | both ends (u0d, u1d) |
| restore | no speed + no duplex on the DUT first | connected trunk a-half a-10 while the 4050 was still forced 10/full (parallel detection) | no speed + no duplex: connected 10 a-full a-1000 (2.8 s, u0e) | both ends |
